      <p>etcd (pronounced et-see-dee) is a consistent, distributed key-value store that stores small amounts of data across a cluster of machines that can fit entirely in memory. As the core component of many projects, etcd is also the primary data store for Kubernetes, which is the standard system for container orchestration.</p>
      <p>By using etcd, you can benefit in several ways:</p>
